        "description": "Calculates the inverse sine of cells in a raster.",
        "in_raster_or_constant.descr": "<xdoc><p>The input for which to calculate the inverse sine values.</p><p>To use a number as an input for this parameter, the cell size and extent must first be set in the environment.</p></xdoc>",
